    subgraph STEPS["What happens at each step"]
        direction TB
        S1["<b>Before any agent runs</b><br>rate limit → 6-layer input guardrail (+ decoding of disguised attacks) → PII redaction<br>an attack is refused here and no agent ever sees it<br>the masked text is what everything downstream reads"]
        S2["<b>1 · Symptom-Intake</b> — agent, L2<br>turns messy, multilingual free text into one clean<br>clinical sentence plus keywords. Also the orchestrator:<br>it runs the workers in a fixed, safety-gated order"]
        S3["<b>2 · Severity-Classifier</b> — agent, L2<br>the only trained model. RandomForest → acuity P1–P5<br>with a confidence and a real SHAP explanation.<br>Falls back to an LLM, then to keyword rules"]
        S4["<b>3 · Safety-Override</b> — agent, L2 over an L1 floor<br>deterministic red-flag rules that can ONLY raise acuity.<br>A semantic NLP layer may add concerns on top<br>but can never remove the rules underneath"]
        S5["<b>4 · Care-Routing</b> — agent, L2<br>maps final acuity to a care tier, then picks a real,<br>verified, currently-open clinic with a travel estimate.<br>Degrades to a labelled estimate, never a fabricated route"]
        S6["<b>5 · Human-in-the-Loop</b> — policy node<br>escalates on low confidence or a safety trigger.<br>Deliberately deterministic: the rule for 'get a human'<br>should be inspectable and stable"]
        S7["<b>6 · Reflection / Critic</b> — policy node<br>re-checks the assembled decision and can only make it<br>MORE cautious — e.g. forcing escalation of an<br>un-escalated P1/P2. Bounded: 1 iteration by default"]
        S8["<b>7 · Clinician-Handoff</b> — agent, L2<br>runs ONLY when a case is escalated. Builds the packet<br>the clinician reads: summary, evidence, citations, SHAP.<br>Checked for faithfulness by evaluation E8"]
        S9["<b>Before the patient sees anything</b><br>the output guardrail screens the rationale for prompt-leak.<br>Every step is written to a SHA-256 hash-chained audit log,<br>and the clinician's decision becomes ground truth"]
        S1 ~~~ S2 ~~~ S3 ~~~ S4 ~~~ S5 ~~~ S6 ~~~ S7 ~~~ S8 ~~~ S9
    end

